--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Vendored code

The following parts of this repository were copied from PowerZooJax and are
distributed under that project's MIT licence. Each copied file names its
upstream path in its header.

  powermarketjax/case/          network cases, PTDF and graph matrices
  powermarketjax/physics/       DC, AC (Newton) and radial BFS power flow
  powermarketjax/resources/     battery, renewable, flexible-load, EV and
                                diesel device models
  powermarketjax/data/          dataset loader, manifests and registry
  powermarketjax/spaces.py      space definitions
  powermarketjax/utils/         JAX helpers and typing
  tests/                        the test files whose header names an
                                upstream path

