Data

Network cases and datasets under powermarketjax/case/ and powermarketjax/data/
carry their own terms, listed in README.md ("Public data sources"). The
RTS-GMLC disclaimer in powermarketjax/case/raw_cases/rts_gmlc/LICENCE.md must
accompany every copy of that data, and
powermarketjax/case/raw_cases/egrimod_nem/LICENCE.md gives the CC BY 4.0 terms
of that case.
